  "details": "Noticed when I went from an EU instance to an USW instance, the Here tab retained the EU flag, and when I went to a JP instance, it switched to that properly, but when I switched out of the JP instance, the here tab did not update then and it's currently stuck as the JP flag.\n\nUpdate: did more tests this morning and determined EU and JP flags will display correctly, but when switching to a US instance (either W or E) the Here tab will retain the international flag (EU or JP) of the last instance you were in before switching to a US server.\n\nUpdate 2: This bug also applies to flags displayed when viewing someone's location via their QM profile.",
